-/* OPTIMISATIONS v6.7.12-perf10:
+/* OPTIMISATIONS v1.4.0:
+   - WebGL2: fix texStorage2D internal format gl.RGB -> gl.RGB8 (format non-sized = INVALID_ENUM, ecran noir WebGL2 corrige)
